# Binary files: never convert line endings, never diff as text.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true on a Windows checkout rewrote the bytes
# inside these workbooks on the way to disk, and git then saw them as
# "modified" the instant they were checked out. That is how checking out main
# on 2026-09-05 stalled a fast-forward merge with 17 workbooks under
# workbooks/ reported changed that nobody had touched. Text files keep the
# default behaviour; only the binaries are named here.
*.xlsm binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.zip  binary
*.dump binary
